  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Setup**: Tiles are stacked (wood wall). Each player draws 16 tiles. 2. **Tile Hierarchy**: Civil (Wen) has 11 ranksâ€”6-6 (Heaven) highest; Military (Wu) has 10 ranksâ€”2-4 and 1-2 (The Supreme) highest. 3. **Lead**: Winner of previous trick (or dealer on first) leads 1â€“4 tiles (single, pair, or set of 3â€“4 matching). 4. **Follow**: Others must play the same number of tiles. To win the trick, beat every tile in the lead with higher-ranking tiles of the same suit. 5. **Bury**: If you cannot beat the lead, bury tiles face down (waste). 6. **Final Trick**: Winning the 16th trick scores 1 point (2 if won with a Supreme set). First team to target (11 or 21) wins.',
    Player: '1. **Setup**: Tiles are stacked (wood wall). Each player draws 16 tiles. 2. **Tile Hierarchy**: Civil (Wen) has 11 ranksâ€”6-6 (Heaven) highest; Military (Wu) has 10 ranksâ€”2-4 and 1-2 (The Supreme) highest. 3. **Lead**: Winner of previous trick (or dealer on first) leads 1â€“4 tiles (single, pair, or set of 3â€“4 matching). 4. **Follow**: Others must play the same number of tiles. To win the trick, beat every tile in the lead with higher-ranking tiles of the same suit. 5. **Bury**: If you cannot beat the lead, bury tiles face down (waste). 6. **Final Trick**: Winning the 16th trick scores 1 point (2 if won with a Supreme set). First team to target (11 or 21) wins.',
    objective: 'Win the final trick of the hand. The winner of the final trick is paid by the other players according to chips won; winning all 16 tricks wins all chips. Session may end with Gobah (five more deals), the last being Tashi Gobah.',
    gameplay: '1. **Setup**: Tiles are stacked (wood wall). Each player draws 16 tiles. 2. **Tile Hierarchy**: Civil (Wen) has 11 ranksâ€”6-6 (Heaven) highest; Military (Wu) has 10 ranksâ€”2-4 and 1-2 (The Supreme) highest. 3. **Lead**: Winner of previous trick (or dealer on first) leads 1â€“4 tiles (single, pair, or set of 3â€“4 matching). 4. **Follow**: Others must play the same number of tiles. To win the trick, beat every tile in the lead with higher-ranking tiles of the same suit. 5. **Bury**: If you cannot beat the lead, bury tiles face down (waste). 6. **Final Trick**: Winning the 16th trick scores 1 point (2 if won with a Supreme set). First team to target (11 or 21) wins.',
